":25797909,"login":"phamtien1709","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzk3OTA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/commits/5d174657d8f8a88a4d31a95ce723ae9ebded7035/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:09:01Z","email":"tien.pham@politetech.com","name":"Tian Lee"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:10:18Z","email":"tien.pham@politetech.com","name":"Tian Lee"},"message":"feat(audition): add multiplayer Neon Dance rhythm game and Dance Lab\n\nNeon Dance (/audition): Audition-style rhythm game. Each turn is one\n4-beat bar: type the arrow sequence, then hit Space on beat 4. Judging\nruns client-side against each player''s own audio clock with a\nper-device latency offset, so network lag never affects timing.\n\n- Rooms (in-memory, like Ma Soi): host picks song, stage and Del mode,\n  adds bots; players pick a character and press Ready; host can only\n  start when everyone is ready, and cannot leave mid-song.\n- Shared keys: sequences are seeded by (game seed, turn, level), so\n  players at the same level get the same keys on the same turn.\n- Levels never drop from failing; Missed locks the next turn. After 3\n  turns at level 9 the next turn is a Finish Move (always has a red Del\n  key), capped per song length, forced on the last turn; afterwards\n  levels above 6 reset to 6.\n- Bots are simulated on the server clock with the same rules.\n- Top scorer steps forward; others form a back row. Live ranking,\n  results ranking, win/lose sounds.\n- Three songs with measured BPM/downbeat: Tieu thuyet tinh yeu (84),\n  Chi la ao giac (106), Khong tin mot som mai binh yen (84).\n\nDance Lab (/dance-lab): preview the six retargeted Mixamo characters\nand their 13 clips on three stages, with front lighting, hand/foot\nlight trails and beat-synced playback (utils/danceSync).","tree":{"sha":"f4bb2093dbf68911ec8a1fc8e7d1c70e1a36863a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/trees/f4bb2093dbf68911ec8a1fc8e7d1c70e1a36863a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/commits/5d174657d8f8a88a4d31a95ce723ae9ebded7035","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25797909?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phamtien1709","id":25797909,"login":"phamtien1709","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1Nzk3OTA5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phamtien1709","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PoliceTeam/musicque/commit/5d174657d8f8a88a4d31a95ce723ae9ebded7035","node_id":"C_kwDOOJvfaNoAKDVkMTc0NjU3ZDhmOGE4OGE0ZDMxYTk1Y2U3MjNhZTllYmRlZDcwMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PoliceTeam/musicque/commit/c100f61add628d8ddd952a9c4e3d9dc40afcabdb","sha":