\n- spotify.css: --pt-blue/green/red/yellow plus -deep / -soft / -ink variants,\n  with dark-theme overrides; defined once, nothing hard-coded elsewhere\n- hub: hero poster for Tiến Lên (card fan, Vào sảnh CTA) and five equal\n  tinted \"SẮP RA MẮT\" tiles, each with its own brand tone; catalog gets `tone`\n- lobby: header with brand dots, blue hero with the three entry actions and a\n  live \"bàn còn chỗ\" pill, resume bar, stake note, table cards accented by\n  status (waiting green, starting yellow, playing red, finished blue), seat\n  avatars in the four brand colours, empty-state card, modal shell with a\n  four-colour stripe\n- CardFan: shared decorative illustration\n- no behaviour change; old lobby rules removed from thirteen.css and replaced\n  by styles/card-lobby.css. Keyboard focus rings, reduced motion, no\n  horizontal scroll at 390px, light and dark checked in headless Chrome\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c084f2648b39f58b20b9cdaececf480e83b8ccb1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/trees/c084f2648b39f58b20b9cdaececf480e83b8ccb1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/commits/044deb8826badb3cd525714b4c2b6083b4fc7398","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146305529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiez02","id":146305529,"login":"andiez02","node_id":"U_kgDOCLhx-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.gi