he Ma Sói / Cờ thú style, below them\n\nCardGamesPromo moves from above the quick-toys row to the end of the sidebar\nbanner stack (Ma Sói, Cờ thú, Game bài) and is redrawn as the same kind of\nposter: green felt, three fanned cards, eyebrow, big uppercase title,\nsubtitle and a status pill. Same width as the other two, light/dark alike,\nreduced-motion safe.\n\nChecked at 1440x900 in headless Chrome. The third banner overflowed the nav\npanel onto the chat box, so the sidebar now keeps the nav at full height,\nscrolls when the screen is too short, and the chat box minimum drops to 180px.\n\n- test: sidebar order quick-toys, Ma Sói, Cờ thú, Game bài (HomePage)\n- test: banner parts and decoration (CardGamesPromo)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d74e69fefa0a23ce0e9f9cc20fdd8bb90a67eced","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/trees/d74e69fefa0a23ce0e9f9cc20fdd8bb90a67eced"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/commits/3b8cf35eb328312c429032a425ee7cc0f2b6400e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146305529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiez02","id":146305529,"login":"andiez02","node_id":"U_kgDOCLhx-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andi