at(thirteen): redesign stake picker as a discrete slider\n\nReplace the antd Segmented with a pill-shaped track modelled on the Claude\neffort picker: dot ticks per stop, a white thumb, a lighter green fill left\nof the thumb that animates (200ms) and turns into a subtle pixel-grid with a\nsweeping highlight on the top stop.\n\n- native input[type=range] over the track gives drag, tick click, touch and\n  arrow/Home/End keys; aria-valuetext carries the stake label\n- unaffordable stops stay visible but dim; a move onto one snaps to the\n  nearest affordable stop (stepping over a locked stop when needed) and a\n  hint says why\n- shimmer is CSS only and disabled under prefers-reduced-motion\n- props API unchanged, so the create modal and host control are untouched\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08fdd6bf609fd13eaf34dd84b37e2aafa927d275","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/trees/08fdd6bf609fd13eaf34dd84b37e2aafa927d275"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/commits/1e27d676517e460037e448afceead218d443e7a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146305529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiez02","id":146305529,"login":"andiez02","node_id":"U_kgDOCLhx-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su