card (or after\nleaving and rejoining) remounted with dealOnMount still true and the deal\nreplayed mid-match. Only \"Quay lại bàn\" reset it.\n\ncloseOverlay now clears dealOnMount together with the open flag, and the\nunseated branch uses the same function, so every reopen path is covered.\nThe now-redundant reset on \"Quay lại bàn\" is removed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6979a46b66076b9f7d35d1a57a685eef4e8b408d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/trees/6979a46b66076b9f7d35d1a57a685eef4e8b408d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/commits/8c154d2b3e71f69b3549e0f3f03dd3f9924e4af5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146305529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiez02","id":146305529,"login":"andiez02","node_id":"U_kgDOCLhx-Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PoliceTeam/musicque/commit/8c154d2b3e71f69b3549e0f3f03dd3f9924e4af5","node_id":"C_kwDOOJvfaNoAKDhjMTU0ZDJiM2U3MWY2OWIzNTQ5ZTBmM2YwM2RkM2Y5OTI0ZTRhZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PoliceTeam/musicque/commit/141e8cb4b5b0f2