com/users/andiez02/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/commits/9ad1da190875a240a1c49e600a5d6c154420e2b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:04:23Z","email":"ken1162004@gmail.com","name":"andiez02"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T05:04:23Z","email":"ken1162004@gmail.com","name":"andiez02"},"message":"fix(card-table-3d): keep undealt own cards pinned to the deck while the camera rotates\n\nOwn-seat hand cards are parented to the camera anchor. While waiting for\ntheir deal stagger (index < 0) they were only re-posed when\nfrom.zone === ''hand'', but dealMotion''s `from` has no zone, so the card\nstayed frozen in camera-local space and followed the drag-look yaw.\nRe-apply the source-space pose every waiting frame for every card, and\nkeep the hand lift only for hand sources.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06d5c05bf8ea5dc43efa53bf01498a13c2a2be4a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/trees/06d5c05bf8ea5dc43efa53bf01498a13c2a2be4a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PoliceTeam/musicque/git/commits/9ad1da190875a240a1c49e600a5d6c154420e2b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146305529?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/andiez02/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/andiez02","id":146305529,"login