ent to track and apply changes for classification, ensuring accurate updates during Excel imports.\n- Refactored useElementEditing hook to manage classification changes effectively, improving state management for edited elements.","tree":{"sha":"dc35fa27ebec3e779d3544b44ea24ca069203591","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/dc35fa27ebec3e779d3544b44ea24ca069203591"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/b15e96a6b5a5e55c30514c523a72d08a88ad3135","verification":{"payload":"tree dc35fa27ebec3e779d3544b44ea24ca069203591\nparent 04a510a106981be6c20321820886d254fd963238\nauthor Louis Trümpler <78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com> 1766135884 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1766135884 +0100\n\nfeat: add classification fields to ElementQuantityUpdate and enhance update logic (#49)\n\n- Introduced optional fields for classification_id, classification_name, and classification_system in ElementQuantityUpdate interface.\n- Updated MongoDBHelper to handle classification updates alongside quantity updates, allowing for more flexible data handling.\n- Enhanced MainPage component to track and apply changes for classification, ensuring accurate updates during Excel imports.\n- Refactored useElementEditing hook to manage classification changes effectively, improving state management for edited elements.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpRRhMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvPkQACyHXf+Pr31jglI++3cKetlm\nVD9j+JV4jDCFkd+bIcVOpc4vrgdZSAexHzwZvnwmMAEixflObUaABKdU/kgHGYXV\nX+pwBOElvgjuwfOy+HT2G1k9BaET79MHtQhUsihOOXvEalPAlz2upGwwEymVcsGH\nxM1Kl1FR/ZCwzat15F8qLJ3OxKsFX1ROom0dMtq9SqI6B6JZ9qR40TDusFEiyn5q\nj1/8X4CDmjAfIouE8aqymQ8wGyg7QLFU69fYLxC8qqsoZ3AyOlnEHPw+1Izz3Mfg\nkgQ66wDxFRj88g60tFs4hbp1JYitcso3Y9iR/UlV7oKz+wMw0nK9beJy0+3Fw48I\n2/Zept/wG2/UFY8l5dlDVupzjniNus+Q//6Joj++M+HirrWTZdJXDYbFnI8VpppB\nxwRIatdqc7KXdmvK25GZQZsnaEEZZTozLG3GPnFmckhcqBwOz/cVAJNUk4owxu0j\nhesg0KIIF