ta clarity during exports.","tree":{"sha":"0f7bdb75785e9284e6ca6ca5fc3b507af07547fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/0f7bdb75785e9284e6ca6ca5fc3b507af07547fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/04a510a106981be6c20321820886d254fd963238","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f7bdb75785e9284e6ca6ca5fc3b507af07547fd\nparent 72cda0348d48a7df8c0ba4824bc1c42049eb63d4\nauthor Louis Trümpler <78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com> 1763110947 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1763110947 +0100\n\nrefactor: simplify floating point comparison logic in ExcelImportDialog (#48)\n\n* refactor: simplify floating point comparison logic in ExcelImportDialog\n\n- Updated the areNumbersEqual function to treat null and undefined as equivalent and streamlined the comparison logic for numeric values with tolerance.\n- Removed unnecessary normalization steps, enhancing clarity and performance in quantity comparison during Excel imports.\n\n* fix: correct groupedElements calculation and improve Excel export value handling\n\n- Updated the calculation of groupedElements in useEbkpGroups to use elementsInTypeGroup for accuracy.\n- Enhanced the ExcelService to export actual values, treating null/undefined as empty and including zero values for area, length, and volume, improving data clarity during exports.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpFvAjCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9OEQAHpbyLh/G4URKzqxvQ/JhgtH\nZ2atjAGdDQGD8gY3eXcRSh6XGHNWihA9BP8YceKIzTMuwPEGWUy/0M8O3gnWy9NB\nL6UrbLk+C8C/ioi0X1qlkyKUBOXeOiyeheG2KfKIk6pyvWzGwKp3AP9DIas5smOi\nfVcKMwPUjN9QLPYv8nbj+v39OnXriiTah0jiDNt/T7e1cyYcKm//QJk4yce8MK2F\nTYUKcZ3I3Rt8wdbaypGM+/fhAKjrZx65fEr/nDT+/tWTjYQvwlt2c2fk9IHMqN5D\ntm0gXYxKm+iHvEXvxmmjoynW1HjPsysm6fD69q/9BkUxej1YcJE0lo4dA6rmbWss\n8tgeFEtnhZGLkj2rpLn0gJOq78WecpfAmipk9/2rsC8q2ySBPUkQNTu1LaM1G+aS\nx7yjPQIJPQN/++ttGO1R7kEHBEDaM0pZ5jZc3U7fmpen6gQjKjGrtepFY2yYh/AB\nbpXq1SUjb/EutZB