/louistrue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/louistrue","id":78563314,"login":"louistrue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTYzMzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/commits/72cda0348d48a7df8c0ba4824bc1c42049eb63d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-05T08:18:20Z","email":"78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Louis Trümpler"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T08:18:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: enhance quantity handling and field updates in element models and components (#47)\n\n* feat: enhance quantity handling and field updates in element models and components\n\n- Added optional fields for area, length, and volume in ElementQuantityUpdate and related models to support direct updates.\n- Updated quantity update logic in MongoDBHelper to handle area, length, and volume based on quantity type.\n- Refactored ExcelImportDialog and MainPage components to track and apply changes for area, length, and volume during Excel imports.\n- Improved MaterialsTable to display material information consistently, including volume calculations and formatting.\n- Adjusted ExcelService to exclude quantity fields from import/export, streamlining data handling.\n\n* feat: enhance Excel import processing and quantity comparison logic\n\n- Introduced smooth progress updates during file processing in ExcelImportDialog.\n- Added helper functions for comparing floating point numbers and normalizing values for quantity changes.\n- Updated MainPage to track changes against current element states, improving accuracy in quantity updates.\n- Refactored ExcelService to exclude zero and null values during export, enhancing data clarity.\n\n* refactor: improve value normalization and comparison logic in ExcelImportDialog and MainPage\n\n- Updated normalization functions to treat null, undefined, and empty strings consistently.\n- Enhanced comparison logic to include equality checks with tolerance for floating-point numbers.\n- Simplified comments for clarity regarding value handling in both components.","tree":{"sha":"d581acdb17f1c782bbf74adc4b07a377b1c4bd32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/d581acdb17f1c782bbf74adc4b07a377b1c4bd32"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/72cda0348d48a7df8c0ba4824bc1c42049eb63d4","verification":{"payload":"tree d581acdb17f1c782bbf74adc4b07a377b1c4bd32\nparent f9d59a177a7aa19b03d98513bdbf9ff45d87474b\nauthor Louis Trümpler <78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com> 1762330700 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1762330700 +0100\n\nfeat: enhance quantity handling and field updates in element models and components (#47)\n\n* feat: enhance quantity handling and field updates in element models and components\n\n- Added optional fields for area, length, and volume in ElementQuantityUpdate and related models to support direct updates.\n- Updated quantity update logic in MongoDBHelper to handle area, length, and volume based on quantity type.\n- Refactored ExcelImportDialog and MainPage components to track and apply changes for area, length, and volume during Excel imports.\n- Improved MaterialsTable to display material information consistently, including volume calculations and formatting.\n- Adjusted ExcelService to exclude quantity fields from import/export, streamlining data handling.\n\n* feat: enhance Excel import processing and quantity comparison logic\n\n- Introduced smooth progress updates during file processing in ExcelImportDialog.\n- Added helper functions for comparing floating point numbers and normalizing values for quantity changes.\n- Updated MainPage to track changes against current element states, improving accuracy in quantity updates.\n- Refactored ExcelService to exclude zero and null values during export, enhancing data clarity.\n\n* refactor: improve value normalization and comparison logic in ExcelImportDialog and MainPage\n\n- Updated normalization functions to treat null, undefined, and empty strings consistently.\n- Enhanced comparison logic to include equality checks with tolerance for floating-point numbers.\n- Simplified comments for clarity regarding value handling in both components.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpCwhMCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5qAQAHXCp6uy2f90oMHkl6/lLALU\nmatLi0M2QmQDRVb1d9ROkY7JxZlhpkUtKtURt+oi3wTdtpTEhtr4t9uZqox/5Tyd\nl9zuJV6/tEago5t7xy33KaqJmWDMwx9Kb9KvXAxDuXaoyWNCrLGNSV88q6ZTFUx2\nYga2hV9XBYNehTvxYtivY3jFr6qXVmyA/tuTTwyPSAw10yI7ZOaXxxdE56fCiAuY\nFyWHBX1i+XNpW72rTnyInzCu+6KEaZZ7th/MYNSzoudde8XL1ifI67e+ARpcvQ0a\n0Zq9u69xJNle5YxQHF82iKjubxWCiSyXU2RGxfexg4bIC5Zns9EfS7Pk/zbzXDC4\nx83b4ga7XAX7vWzht8s/xcZ1JGAqcAqUuhsyHQbC5TfuWaLZYsU2cnIZ9/BAR6tu\nuksfH6tjElavgGtbpAuNb25nx2y/kg8lzzEya90M9bQwyxDt/i9A7d37cIEZYjJP\nhoEKQ51tQ2Vo5HNNofsTonOoMGyjEuCkGI9NCloZj9cfRX82Y0DBhygI6CUKme1o\nQ3HTyuBdENIWiq7D1OS9rV4V0ZS1B0l4tqRNtDz+3fMS9jaSzuAQSqS7H6hBm1MY\nlmYMIDgklXaOINSqYln+hjmMzr+igBUbDnqmp5yAbvpVz0snztvCpPICujWbTUkh\nRhxqeD/vOzNxFdjo+vWu\n=hbto\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-11-05T08:18:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https:/