ing in MainPage component (#45)\n\n* feat: enhance element tracking and quantity handling in MainPage component\n\n- Introduced state management for original elements to facilitate comparison during Excel imports.\n- Updated quantity handling to track changes for all edited elements, regardless of manual status.\n- Refactored comments for clarity and improved type handling for quantity changes, including volume.\n- Enhanced logic to store original element data for better tracking of quantity modifications during imports.\n\n* fix: improve quantity change tracking and validation in MainPage component\n\n- Enhanced logic to track quantity changes by comparing both value and type against original elements.\n- Added validation for quantity types to ensure only supported types are processed, with logging for invalid types.\n- Initialized state for original elements to facilitate accurate comparisons during imports.\n\n* fix: refine quantity change detection logic in MainPage component\n\n- Updated the condition for tracking quantity changes to ensure proper handling of null values.\n- Enhanced comparison logic to prevent errors when original quantity data is not available.","tree":{"sha":"86d9877bc1bd923723bac3bc75941151883ff87d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/86d9877bc1bd923723bac3bc75941151883ff87d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/2c531a6b22049a404095d42e06804560670525b2","verification":{"payload":"tree 86d9877bc1bd923723bac3bc75941151883ff87d\nparent 959c7f1d4f5e1d76d1c1e82dc97ae90bb6f49306\nauthor Louis Trümpler <78563314+louistrue@users.noreply.github.com> 1761559904 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1761559904 +0100\n\nfeat: enhance element tracking and quantity handling in MainPage component (#45)\n\n* feat: enhance element tracking and quantity handling in MainPage component\n\n- Introduced state management for original elements to facilitate comparison during Excel imports.\n- Updated quantity handling to track changes for all edited elements, regardless of manual status.\n- Refactored comments for clarity and improved type handling for quantity changes, including volume.\n- Enhanced logic to store original element data for better tracking of quantity modifications during imports.\n\n* fix: improve quantity change tracking and validation in MainPage component\n\n- Enhanced logic to track quantity changes by comparing both value and type against original elements.\n- Added validation for quantity types to ensure only supported types are processed, with logging for invalid types.\n- Initialized state for original elements to facilitate accurate comparisons during imports.\n\n* fix: refine quantity change detection logic in MainPage component\n\n- Updated the condition for tracking quantity changes to ensure proper handling of null values.\n- Enhanced comparison logic to prevent errors when original quantity data is not available.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJo/0VgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHNcQAGu2jCnggsXffMSPBDRxlXV2\nC/zJ9vdYrzRsvg/Mr7cKNBA5hxVkaopcrP/MT8j0HJfnWVRNWwmAHrEIVKjbfh79\n5WR+YWDF3PdUQ4KHW3/O5AllVFBMZ4ZDbP9wGzvmom5Lz2GkP+CkZvQf1/7nIpUp\nUVmHhikGRBaqPCq3PKuRSSehZgCXZY+nf91Mb6MGdC9bPmaNz8LyEseZMtmuILYs\nGxGkqhLmR0t5jWglA91Hnk4vXbXKxINWBLe1mInBDREHEtUVyr/5jFKMpMXsEDQ8\nI0kV/oUIQM5gRbKj+ZwWO/16r7C1yaxuOB8Hav2ACJ33Helr/11YqfX1jYQH9kZF\noCy/8dAnugU3ABYXJUQ/D4inKZ8zg+5docTgbbM2QbfzYa6UoXfODrZqLa6je8b0\nSk+EGiuqUm2OnExZH4qJqldZQ2fcVnbup9yVBLC5/clNCUyiqoroh+GRH3HVu3Hm\n+oL5f1FJVWJXXZIHk1cLSPr/Amprhhk8KTn3/xSiAhfpu9DD9MyD++bQOPe2Asdi\nzvLz6SQablqvjpQmUMveVjYAhbUtFEeCUP7RxOJLK7fO4CIKcQ7qjWhN2kTHggCl\nHaTfT0FsrMwR1KBNM4tN9I34CskYYRFxC2R4GqTpoYOaqAHazG84QHwNNOrOlImQ\n4saOC11JoT/6atBiXyCs\n=b3re\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-10-27T10:11:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.