 main groups and their respective subgroups.\n- Enhanced `useEbkpGroups` hook to create and return hierarchical group structures based on EBKP codes.\n- Refactored related components to accommodate the new hierarchical structure, including updates to element rendering and status handling.\n- Improved UI elements for better interaction, including expand/collapse functionality and status indicators for groups and elements.","tree":{"sha":"5f907ddf401c30ce17035138396ef6f381ef2b37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/5f907ddf401c30ce17035138396ef6f381ef2b37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/95a88f1ff0ed1a8e0a9b978e3c926fdec1ee5cf5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78563314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/louistrue","id":78563314,"login":"louistrue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTYzMzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/commit/95a88f1ff0ed1a8e0a9b978e3c926fdec1ee5cf5","node_id":"C_kwDOOK0H6doAKDk1YTg4ZjFmZjBlZDFhOGUwYTliOTc4ZTNjOTI2ZmRlYzFlZTVjZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https:/