r"},"message":"Refactor file upload handling and improve error management\n\n- Updated the file upload process to use the provided filename from the form field for validation and staging.\n- Enhanced error handling during file staging, including checks for empty uploads and improved logging for better traceability.\n- Sanitized filenames to prevent path traversal vulnerabilities.\n- Cleaned up partially written files in case of errors during the upload process.","tree":{"sha":"ebce6a9daa94e5f3a8f7198cc5482c7b798e4fbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/ebce6a9daa94e5f3a8f7198cc5482c7b798e4fbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/750faac7bcac0f5cad9672c2648dc83b59862909","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78563314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/louistrue","id":78563314,"login":"louistrue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTYzMzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/commit/750faac7bcac0f5cad9672c2648dc83b59862909","node_id":"C_kwDOOK0H6doAKDc1MGZhYWM3YmNhYzBmNWNhZDk2NzJjMjY0OGRjODNiNTk