strue@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Louis Trümpler"},"message":"Refactor Kafka consumer and MinIO integration for improved file handling\n\n- Updated the Kafka consumer to use a more structured message handler that includes offset resolution and heartbeat management.\n- Enhanced error handling and logging during message processing, ensuring offsets are resolved.\n- Refactored file retrieval from MinIO to return a Readable stream instead of a Buffer, allowing for more efficient file uploads.\n- Modified the sendIFCFile function to directly append the file stream to FormData, eliminating the need for temporary file storage.\n- Improved logging for better visibility into the processing flow and error scenarios.","tree":{"sha":"2e6b6319920124b9e5d39c7fe23608866812393e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/trees/2e6b6319920124b9e5d39c7fe23608866812393e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LTplus-AG/NHMzh-plugin-qto/git/commits/5f9ec6e573829514b362ba3b57b208625471de2d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78563314?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/louistrue","id":78563314,"login":"louistrue","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4NTYzMzE0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/louistrue/subscriptions","type":"Use