lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nishiegroe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nishiegroe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nishiegroe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nishiegroe/NishieGroePersonalWebsite/commits/29e678301f5d76c6e967f0c9b5ac5f4584b68409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:54:07Z","email":"nishiegroe@gmail.com","name":"Nishie Groe"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T22:54:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(projects): add Veridian Esports, switch grid to 2-up, show full-aspect previews (#42)\n\nAdds Veridian Esports as the first project card with five production\nscreenshots (webp, 619KB total).\n\nLayout changes that apply to all projects:\n- Grid goes 2-up from sm instead of 3-across, so the fourth card no\n  longer strands alone on its own row.\n- Image previews render at their own aspect ratio (width:100%,\n  height:auto) instead of a fixed 140px box with objectFit:cover,\n  which cropped every screenshot to a centre band.\n- cardHeader minHeight 16rem -> 13rem. 16rem was sized for the old\n  3-across grid and left ~100px of dead space under each description\n  at 2-up. 13rem is the tallest real header at md''s narrowest\n  (USG.com, 206px at a 900px viewport).\n\nVerified: build exit 0; image tops align 0px delta across 900-1920;\nno horizontal overflow down to 360px.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X9roP4UoFMTgn6A2jvPpuH\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"797f6d89f2b4b823255b62edd395d68ead8cb938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nishiegroe/NishieGroePersonalWebsite/git/trees/797f6d89f2b4b823255b62edd395d68ead8cb938"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nishiegroe/NishieGroePersonalWebsite/git/commits/29e678301f5d76c6e967f0c9b5ac5f4584b68409","verification":{"payload":"tree 797f6d89f2b4b823255b62edd395d68ead8cb938\nparent a9ace1130d0847f0cb91272e3b3cc81d9d00ae41\nauthor Nishie Groe <nishiegroe@gmail.com> 1788044047 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788044047 -0500\n\nfeat(projects): add Veridian Esports, switch grid to 2-up, show full-aspect previews (#42)\n\nAdds Veridian Esports as the first project card with five production\nscreenshots (webp, 619KB total).\n\nLayout changes that apply to all projects:\n- Grid goes 2-up from sm instead of 3-across, so the fourth card no\n  longer strands alone on its own row.\n- Image previews render at their own aspect ratio (width:100%,\n  height:auto) instead of a fixed 140px box with objectFit:cover,\n  which cropped every screenshot to a centre band.\n- cardHeader minHeight 16rem -> 13rem. 16rem was sized for the old\n  3-across grid and left ~100px of dead space under each description\n  at 2-up. 13rem is the tallest real header at md''s narrowest\n  (USG.com, 206px at a 900px viewport).\n\nVerified: build exit 0; image tops align 0px delta across 900-1920;\nno horizontal overflow down to 360px.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X9roP4UoFMTgn6A2jvPpuH\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqk2MPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAASrIQAIgRvK+OLzwD8rI44xrizTQy\n8XxIZefdSq+Xlm/e9Ys3xHeQr5vQZ9kiFSLBmkO83KT3k6scSpIwRJxIuepiY4bN\nQLeFBDd+6Zwdu4Xe7Hwd2fkPDLtT2B5NTIF02liCXHStsjzESBSdrKI9Acjy/1wm\ngnrXDFEFQGjhy6SAqb62dfTe3WE6R9kE3mOoNhfLt8xKCSYgpdbvhnjc0ab2XR+k\n17CF3yZdFcF9ggCD/4XBUtdwi0rp+npWaCkjMyeSfK+LeFtPui7sm1VSOXlIJ7Xb\nnSa2i3q6lIIqAEFpWOkH3q7O4+ydjAw+Ny5LfxIC58hqUmVpxoXYe6ltwCHcl7lk\nl9Q8JYw6ZwKvPOIMZIlr/6P7BHY6F7d4m9tXHozuRP4t4t1dW+gyFMUlK0CQMVFs\n+IfpYu1LoMLjBa+M02NRH+mbTm14GcWZp1yNUJ3gCAGM9jA4MYnZpH+B/5p0QBD3\ngfexHj1BrHFDPr4ocssiQ1W3fgO74QEFRmUDNcVWyhaKuMAQGAmiMNz2P7joQNV6\nRWEtA5RaHoPhhJhuAZr6COvhcaxIQzDL4TYotk6S/zxPtbIIk8r4CVCNq+pGJmck\nQzObc5nkGgRIaaIEmgFBLM9gbVBu6Bw0VQaApuVWj/tjRXW7SzZgUTEwrD90snyf\np3x6