dy(collaborations): Instadeck harness evidence and a comparison with dididecks-ai\n\nSecond collaboration run. Step 1 inventories Instadeck, phoenixcap''s\nfull-stack derivative of dididecks-ai: 44 artifacts at HEAD, each tagged\ndeveloper or in-product harness. Step 2 compares it with dididecks-ai by\nlayer, plus stack, data, architecture, failure and lineage sections.\n\nFramed as differences between approaches, not a ranking. Each side put\nits depth where its generator lives: dididecks inside an operator''s\nClaude Code session, Instadeck in a server pipeline walled off from dev\nmemory.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19726fa56c85049a00d56688766622203ad40aa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/19726fa56c85049a00d56688766622203ad40aa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/0b55c3b86fc6341a72e4521d3c2fc9adcefe54d5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"