ser}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/561ea592bae36bff2ad5c51adabdb41928c6fae9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:34:51Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T18:34:51Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"study(collaborations): Harness evidence and a two-way comparison by layer\n\nThe first collaboration run. Step 1 inventories the collaborator''s repo,\nwith every artifact tagged as developer or in-product harness and cited\nby path at a pinned SHA. Step 2 sets it beside augment-it and\nmemopop-ai: a ledger bucketed within each layer, a layer map, eight\nMermaid diagrams, and ranked recommendations for both sides.\n\nFinding: their developer harness is thin and their in-product harness\ndeep; ours is the mirror image. They can cheaply adopt our developer\nhabits, and their evaluation practice (replay, synthetic tiers,\npreflights, error bars) is the next level for our memo pipeline.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a274a17f267d2ca0d4f7838310da92492eed330","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/7a274a17f267d2ca0d4f7838310da92492eed330"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/