aton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:55:20Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"bump(study): jj profile records the Git LFS incompatibility","tree":{"sha":"538427b461c205294f8eb3ba6bf7b78ffffd3ed3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/538427b461c205294f8eb3ba6bf7b78ffffd3ed3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/bd417cdfbd8c012018895c7d3036e355d7948e96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/bd417cdfbd8c012018895c7d3036e355d7948e96","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGJkNDE3Y2RmYmQ4YzAxMjAxODg5NWM3ZDMwMzZlMzU1ZDc5NDhlOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac","sha":"a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac"}],"sha":"bd417cdfbd8c012018895c7d3036e355d7948e96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/bd417cdfbd8c012018895c7d3036e355d7948e96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:55:07Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:55:07Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"reminder(ai-labs): never run jj in a Git LFS repo\n\nTurns today''s incident into a guardrail. jj git init --colocate was run in the\nreach-edu client repo, which tracks PDFs, docx, and pptx with Git LFS. jj has no\nLFS support and runs no smudge or clean filters, so its first working-copy\nsnapshot replaced 78 pointer files with 282 MB of real bytes in one commit that\ntouched nothing.\n\nFully reverted and nothing was pushed, but had it been, the client''s repo would\nhave gained exactly the blobs LFS was configured to keep out — and removing them\nmeans rewriting history on a client repo.\n\nThe rule is a two-line check before jj git init anywhere, and the reason it is\nneeded is that every ordinary signal reads normal: jj prints Initialized repo,\nthe commit looks unremarkable, and git status is clean on both sides because LFS\nkeeps real bytes on disk by design.\n\nAlso records the recovery, including that jj''s colocate moves the branch ref so a\nreset alone leaves you detached, and states plainly that this does not overturn\nflave''s spec 8.2 — .flave bundles carry no LFS, and the rule is per repo rather\nthan per tool.\n\nAlso included: the study''s jj profile updated with the same finding and a new\nlarge-binaries row in its checklist.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"086eb35350bd7f29e33d1c994ce2e5a17c5b314a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/086eb35350bd7f29e33d1c994ce2e5a17c5b314a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGEwYWIyODdiYjMwODY2NDIzZWJlNzI5MGJkYzZjOWFmM2JiMTNmYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4","sha":"b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4"}],"sha":"a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/a0ab287bb30866423ebe7290bdc6c9af3bb13fac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:45:01Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:45:01Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"plan(ai-labs): Phase 2 read side shipped — the feed renders real history\n\nMarks step 2 done in the sequence table. corpora changes runs over the real\nreach-edu corpus in 0.23 seconds with all sixteen FEED IDs green.\n\nRecords the one deviation: built in corpora-builder rather than augment-it as\nthis plan originally annotated, because the origin clarification made\ncorpora-builder the owner of the corpus concept and it already carried both the\nCLI surface and the spec-driven TDD loop.\n\nAnd records what Phase 2 still owes — the gesture. Save-a-version as a write,\nwith a required sentence, is its own spec; the feed is read-only like\nBrowse-Corpus and creates nothing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"ed0a78f6e545adaa3dcd12f5779bf82b3203a145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/ed0a78f6e545adaa3dcd12f5779bf82b3203a145"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGIwMzllMzUxNDFlN2RlYjdmMzkzN2EwY2U2MGIzYzU3ZGM5ZTE3ZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51","sha":"04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51"}],"sha":"b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b039e35141e7deb7f3937a0ce60b3c57dc9e17d4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:31:30Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:31:30Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"bump(study): Rclone UI viewers recorded as a non-finding\n\nA reader already owns PDF and Office viewers; a client-facing feed only has to\nhand over the file. Recorded so the dependency names do not read as a\nrecommendation to a future session, and the React prohibition is stated plainly\nenough that only the Rust half reads as liftable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"b6917d57642503bc8c014b71cae2763f5c909540","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/b6917d57642503bc8c014b71cae2763f5c909540"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDA0YTY0NWI2NGZiODcwM2M5ZDA5OTBiYTcwMDA0YTNjZDU1NmFiNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877","sha":"ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877"}],"sha":"04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/04a645b64fb8703c9d0990ba70004a3cd556ab51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:28:12Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T21:28:12Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"bump(study): pin Rclone UI as the study''s eighth reference\n\nAdds rclone-ui/rclone-ui with its profile — the first surface rather than engine\nin the collection, pinned because it corrects the exploration''s claim that rclone\ncannot run as a service, and because its 5,167-line Rust scheduler resolves the\ncross-platform run-on-a-schedule residue that exploration left open.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"c58d83f952ffeda26ac18d7986805d3ce8748acc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/c58d83f952ffeda26ac18d7986805d3ce8748acc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGJhOTc4MDk2MDU1MjBlY2VjM2RiZWIxZDZlZTU3YjhlOWRjNTg4Nzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a","sha":"c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a"}],"sha":"ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ba97809605520ecec3dbeb1d6ee57b8e9dc58877"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:43:35Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:43:35Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"plan(ai-labs): Phase 1 shipped — 886 objects, byte-identical round trip\n\nMarks step 1 done in the sequence table and records the result inline, including\nthat the plan''s own target number was wrong: live/ holds 886 objects rather than\n892, because .DS_Store is excluded and 886 is exactly what git tracks.\n\nHand-recoverability moves from intention to measurement — grep over the recovered\ntree works with no corpora-builder installed, which is the property the whole\nsubstrate argument rests on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"f6a7927e624024e52b9321fa96173d4a4e067237","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/f6a7927e624024e52b9321fa96173d4a4e067237"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGM4YWQ4NWMzYzhkYWY0ZGQwYmYwNmVmZjZmZTk1YjQwN2E2MjExNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea","sha":"388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea"}],"sha":"c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/c8ad85c3c8daf4dd0bf06eff6fe95b407a62115a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:33:38Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:33:38Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"plan(ai-labs): rename to what it actually delivers, and lead with the sequence\n\nTwo corrections from the owner, both fair.\n\nThe title was written for an agent. \"Prove the Substrate Before Building\nHistory\" states a discipline rather than a deliverable, and a human scanning\ncontext-v/plans/ could not tell what it produces. Renamed to \"Sync Corpora to\nR2, and Show Clients What Changed\", which names both outputs and matches the\nverb-first tone of its siblings.\n\nThe sequence was also buried. The durable answer from the study is three engines,\none per layer, staged by trigger — rclone now, Kopia when R2 becomes primary,\nAutomerge probably never — plus Syncthing off to the side and the progress feed\nas the only thing we write. That was split across Phase 1 and a table headed\n\"Parked\", so it read as a phase list with exceptions rather than as a sequence.\nAdds a \"plan in one table\" section directly under the title carrying all five\nsteps with their triggers and pointers into the body, and states plainly that\nsteps 1 and 2 are the plan while 3 through 5 are pre-decided answers waiting on\ntriggers, so nobody re-runs the research when one fires.\n\nThe bucket audit stays where it belongs — as the evidence explaining why step 3\nis not already firing, rather than as the headline.\n\nAlso included: inbound references repointed in the flave document-service stub\nand the corpora-builder origin reminder.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"51727862aa110347b716dea6d12aa2ce7a728c06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/51727862aa110347b716dea6d12aa2ce7a728c06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDM4OGU5MDdlZTAzZWIyZjNhZTFiNThlODA1NjNiMzEwOTM1NmQ4ZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7","sha":"71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7"}],"sha":"388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/388e907ee03eb2f3ae1b58e80563b3109356d8ea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:06:12Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:06:12Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"reminder(ai-labs): corpora-builder is not augment-it tooling — origin and purpose\n\nRecords the two things an agent needs to not get wrong about this pair, and moves\nthe substrate guardrail from the same session to the anchor root where it belongs.\n\nOrigin: corpora-builder was built inside augment-it because both centered on\naugmenting record sets for a client, and the first corpus it needed was one\naugment-it already had. It split out once it proved useful standalone and as a\ndidi.sh suite component alongside dididecks-ai and memopop-ai. The relationship\nis inheritance, not overlap — which means the corpus sitting at\naugment-it/clients/<slug>/corpus/ is a legacy of origin and not a principle to\nreason backwards from, the two programs are currently disconnected in fact rather\nthan by design, and moving a corpus toward corpora-builder is a handover rather\nthan a copy. Three consumers makes shared code tempting and it stays prohibited:\nintegration is a verb contract and file formats, never an import.\n\nPurpose: the corpus is a hard boundary, not a retrieval convenience. Cheap\ncapable models mean millions of people will draft documents of consequence they\ncannot risk hallucination in, and restricting factual claims to a corpus is the\nonly real answer available now. That makes corpora-builder foundational to the\nsuite rather than a peer within it, since dididecks-ai and memopop-ai both\ngenerate documents of consequence and are only trustworthy on top of it.\n\nTwo consequences worth stating in the same breath, because the thesis is\nincomplete without them: provenance has to be per claim rather than per document,\nsince a corpus constrains retrieval but not interpolation between retrieved\nfacts; and a weak corpus converts hallucination into confident citation of bad\nsources, which is harder to catch because it looks rigorous. That makes the\nquality scan load-bearing and makes \"the corpus does not support this claim\" a\ncorrect output.\n\nAlso included: Check-The-Substrate-Before-Reasoning-On-Top-Of-It moves to\nlossless-monorepo/context-v/reminders/ with its cross-references repathed, since\nlisting a store before designing over it is tree-wide guidance rather than an\nai-labs concern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"9613c1fe9da0c655771529f238d50b26dfb2cb07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/9613c1fe9da0c655771529f238d50b26dfb2cb07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDcxYWJhMjZiNzIxZTEyNjIyZTdkNDA4ZWUxZDYwYTMxNGRhN2Y3Zjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5","sha":"29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5"}],"sha":"71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/71aba26b721e12622e7d408ee1d60a314da7f7f7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:03:31Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:03:31Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"reminder(ai-labs): check the substrate before reasoning on top of it\n\nTurns today''s mistake into a guardrail. An agent read corpora-builder''s MVP plan,\nsaw SUBSTRATE marked decided, and spent several turns reasoning about which\nversion-control engine belonged on top of that bucket — pinning six upstream\nreferences and producing an adopt-versus-build recommendation. The operator then\nsaid \"I don''t think it''s syncing with the bucket,\" and one read-only listing\nreturned zero objects. The whole question was moot; there was nothing to version.\n\nThe rule is that a plan records intent and does not report state. Decided,\nRESOLVED, and Done when are statements about what someone meant to do, and\nwell-written plans in this tree are dangerous to read passively precisely because\nthey read like descriptions of reality.\n\nPractical guidance: list the store before designing over it, check the whole\ncontainer and not just the configured prefix, confirm the tool is the one doing\nthe work rather than that work is merely happening, prefer a read-only probe over\na passing suite against moto, and say the number out loud because \"0 objects\"\nends a debate adjectives cannot.\n\nAlso included: the second half of the lesson, that a decision producing no\nartifacts over a meaningful stretch is evidence about the decision rather than\nabout execution speed, and the honest response is to downgrade it to deferred\nwith the trigger written down — the same discipline the corpora plan already\nmodelled for its parked BTRFS option, applied evenly.\n\nNotes that Storage-Seam.md already carried the right instinct, gating its\nconformance suite behind a deliberate real-bucket run because moto proving an S3\nclient correct is not the same as R2 accepting it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"c4445001aab4b8b1f3d8766e48d48f604499afb2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/c4445001aab4b8b1f3d8766e48d48f604499afb2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDI5YWRiYTBhZWY3NWIxM2FkMjE3YTdmNTFjNTNkYzcwZWY3ZWUwYzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86","sha":"b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86"}],"sha":"29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/29adba0aef75b13ad217a7f51c53dc70ef7ee0c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:01:41Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T20:01:41Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"plan(ai-labs): record corpora-builder''s origin, which answers the plan''s two biggest open questions\n\nThe owner supplied the missing history: corpora-builder was built inside\naugment-it because it centered on the same use case — augmenting record sets for\na client — and the first corpus it needed was one augment-it already had. As it\nbuilt out it became clear it is useful both standalone and as a didi.sh suite\ncomponent alongside dididecks-ai and memopop-ai.\n\nThat reframes the audit''s finding. \"Two programs, one corpus, no defined\nrelationship\" was wrong in an instructive way: they were one program, and the\nrelationship is inheritance rather than overlap. The corpus sitting inside a\nrecord-enrichment app is a legacy of origin, not a design decision.\n\nPhase 1 keeps its steps and changes its meaning — mirroring the augment-it corpus\ninto corpora-builder''s live/ is the first move of a handover rather than a copy,\nand it forces nothing, because the mirror is one-way and non-destructive.\n\nThree consumers rather than one — record sets, decks, memos — is also the\nstrongest argument yet for corpus-as-its-own-thing, and it re-raises the standing\nno-shared-dependency rule: the integration has to be a service with a verb\ncontract and file formats, never an imported package across the three apps.\n\nTwo questions close and two open in their place: what augment-it reads from after\nthe mirror lands, and whether standalone or suite-integrated ships first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"49ee821f707ea8e46a567379e3830ab74cd385a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/49ee821f707ea8e46a567379e3830ab74cd385a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGIxNmQwMmUxY2U5YzA2NmRjYWNmY2Y5ODgzZmJhYjE2NDFkZjZiODY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d","sha":"ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d"}],"sha":"b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b16d02e1ce9c066dcacfcf9883fbab1641df6b86"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T19:52:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T19:52:33Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(plan): the lede was 153 characters, over the 140 budget\n\nRewrites it to lead with the finding rather than summarizing the plan — zero\nobjects in fourteen days, and the corpus grew anyway — then the instruction in\nfour words. 119 characters, inside the two-rendered-line budget an OpenGraph\nunfurl actually gets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"14e20e20af46064652b3c9c2de2f97a58b761e7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/14e20e20af46064652b3c9c2de2f97a58b761e7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGFiNTQzYmM0ZTdlN2EyOWQzNjk3YmRlNDg4YWQyOWZiOWE2ZmUyN2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78","sha":"b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78"}],"sha":"ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ab543bc4e7e7a29d3697bde488ad29fb9a6fe27d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T19:52:18Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T19:52:18Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"plan(ai-labs): prove the substrate before building history\n\nWrites the plan that acts on today''s bucket audit. The corpora R2 prefix has\nheld zero objects for the fourteen days since SUBSTRATE was decided, while the\nreach-edu corpus grew from 517 to 845 markdown files and its inbox shrank from\n140 to 95 — two weeks of real triage that went nowhere near the bucket. That is\na plan the work is routing around, and the honest response is to change the plan.\n\nThe finding underneath it: the corpus is already versioned. It is a git\nsubmodule, committed and pushed, with a commit DAG and human messages. The\ncapability HISTORY proposed to hand-build as \"git''s data model, minus git\" is\npresent as git, and went uncounted because the plan assumed R2-primary and\nstopped checking. SUBSTRATE''s own justification for leaving git named three\ntriggers — cloud deployment, multi-operator editing, didi-in-the-browser — and\nnone has fired, which is the same discipline that document already applies to the\nparked BTRFS option.\n\nSo: downgrade SUBSTRATE to deferred-with-a-trigger without reversing it or\ntouching the CorpusStore seam, keep git as the history layer, do not write Phase\n4, do not adopt Kopia yet, and mirror the corpus into live/ anyway because it is\nthirty minutes and it converts hand-recoverability from an intention into a\nmeasured fact. Everything parked carries a named re-opening trigger.\n\nThe one thing worth building now is the legibility layer, which no pinned\nreference supplies and which git can feed today. Its interface is specified\nagainst a structured change record rather than git log output, so the surface\nsurvives an engine change later.\n\nAlso included: the migration gap that explains the empty bucket better than any\ntheory about priorities — Phases 0-3 built a forward-only capture path and\nnothing was ever scoped to backfill the 892 files that already existed. And a\nsection on .flave arguing the remote should be a document service rather than a\nself-hosted forge, since a forge is a developer UI that this audience will never\nopen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"07dfa34b8431327e207db3970ebab2c529e1dd80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/07dfa34b8431327e207db3970ebab2c529e1dd80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGIxYWQ5ZDM2NWQ0MTBmMGNjODFhNzgzNTNkY2RhNGVhNjk3NzZiNzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36","sha":"0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36"}],"sha":"b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/b1ad9d365d410f0cc81a78353dcda4ea69776b78"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T19:09:00Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T19:09:00Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"study(ai-labs): open the sync-and-content-version-control study and the syncbox exploration\n\nRegisters lossless-group/study-sync-and-content-version-control as a submodule\nwith six references pinned and profiled — jj, Seafile (both repos), Syncthing,\nrestic, Kopia, Automerge — and writes the exploration that consolidates four\nprior circling documents into one option space.\n\nThe reframe the reading forces: what reads as one product is three layers, and\ntwo of them are already shipped. restic''s repository layout is corpora-builder''s\nHISTORY layout — data/<ab>/<sha256> plus snapshots/ against the same two-hex\nfan-out — and it needs no object versioning, which is the exact R2 gap that sent\nHISTORY application-level. Kopia adds the parts restic lacks: a free-text\nDescription on every snapshot, key-value tags, manual pins, and retention\npolicies that attach per directory and inherit. Legibility is the only layer\nnobody has built, and it is the one the invisible-progress motive actually needs.\n\nTwo prior open questions close. A Syncthing receive-only device does not orphan a\ncollaborator''s edit — it flags it, counts it, and offers Revert — so augment-it''s\noption C is sound as specified. And jj''s colocation guarantee is half a\nrepository: content travels in .git/ while change IDs and the operation log stay\nin .jj/, so a git-only recipient gets the document and loses the undo.\n\nThat last finding also dissolves the contradiction between corpora-builder''s\nHISTORY decision and flave spec 8.2, six days apart and pointing opposite ways.\nThey were never answering the same question — a single-author bundle wants\nkeystroke-grained operation-log undo, a 156MB client corpus wants labelled\ncheckpoints with retention. What they share is the surface, not the store.\n\nAlso included: seasync turns out to be an org publishing unofficial Seafile\nclients rather than a new engine, and Seafile''s S3 backend is Professional\nEdition, so the open-core line falls on the property that prompted the search.\n\nDeliberately not included: the modified augment-it and id-didi-sh gitlinks, which\nwere already dirty and are the operator''s to tidy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BocV5c3MSp3o7Zo4DyXrz5","tree":{"sha":"e46de7dccad7e66559938439caab4a4c5feb2bc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/e46de7dccad7e66559938439caab4a4c5feb2bc6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDBhMDM3ZDZjN2IxNmY4YThhNzZiNjRlMTA5ZTE2OGE5Y2IyYTJiMzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927","sha":"d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927"}],"sha":"0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/0a037d6c7b16f8a8a76b64e109e168a9cb2a2b36"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:58:34Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:58:34Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(context-v): tenancy moved to entities — memos and decks inherit it, they do not reinvent it\n\nThe consumer-wiring guidance told memos and decks to build their own version of\naugment-it''s org-to-workspace binding. That advice is now wrong, and wrong in\nthe expensive direction: it would have produced two more bespoke tenancy models\na month after we decided to stop having them.\n\nThe entities ruling from 2026-08-20 collapses organization, workspace, and\nproject into one table where kind is a display label with no structural meaning\n— no parent_id, no containment, no inheritance. The reasoning is empirical:\nprojects are collaborations among many organizations, so a project belonging to\nexactly one org is the exception, and any hierarchy makes the common case the\nthing you fight the schema to express. A memo collection and a deck are entities\nwith a kind label; who may see them is entity_memberships. augment-it''s\nworkspace.json plus WORKSPACE_ORG_MAP is what a service does when it has no\nentity model, not a pattern worth copying twice more.\n\nThis also corrects a claim the doc made in the opposite direction — that the\nidentity service deliberately knows nothing of workspaces. It now holds the\nentities and the memberships. What stays per-service is the authorization\ndecision: id says which entities you hold and at what role, each service decides\nwhat that role may do. The line moved rather than vanished, and saying so\nmatters because the old phrasing invited exactly the duplicate modelling this\ncommit removes.\n\nTwo consequences recorded rather than left implicit. O6''s deferral of scopes now\nhas a visible reason — entity-scoped grants would invent a grammar before the\nthing it names exists. And Q8 sharpens: under entities the mechanism for\nper-viewer deck access already exists as a membership at viewer role, so the\nquestion stops being whether we can and becomes whether the friction is worth it\non a surface whose whole job is to open for a room.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017HuzSPdPK4QEhs7eztHgoC","tree":{"sha":"abab0f62c254b689ce00c21b015f303bbd7dec6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/abab0f62c254b689ce00c21b015f303bbd7dec6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGQ0OWJkYmExMmVjNGJmMWExZWE4YzYwMDE4YzA5YjA3MjljMTI5Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37","sha":"45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37"}],"sha":"d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/d49bdba12ec4bf1a1ea8c60018c09b0729c12927"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:53:28Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:53:28Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(context-v): the exploration wrote past the authorization-server amendment — two doors, not one\n\nThe consumer-wiring guidance added an hour ago assumed didi.sh was still a\nsession-cookie service. It is not: the 2026-08-20 amendment to the identity\nspec made it an OAuth 2.1 + OIDC authorization server, with discovery and open\nDynamic Client Registration, grown for Claude Desktop''s MCP path and for Onyx\nrather than for our own three services.\n\nThat changes the advice rather than merely decorating it. There are now two\nintegration doors suiting different callers, and the doc says which is which:\nthe cookie for first-party surfaces on *.didi.sh, OAuth for anything the cookie\ncannot reach. memopop-native is the case that moves most — a system-browser\nauthorization-code flow against /oauth2/authorize is now a supported path\ninstead of something we would have had to build, which lowers the cost of the\nTauri item this doc has carried as \"stays hard\" since July.\n\nTwo constraints from the amendment also propagate into planning. O2 binds every\naccess token to a session id, so there is still no machine identity — which\nsharpens the headless-agent question rather than answering it, and Q9 is\nrewritten to name the three real options and lean at delegated user identity so\n\"who ran this memo\" stays answerable. O6 defers entity- and workspace-scoped\ngrants, so neither memos nor decks can express org-scoped access through scopes\nyet, and per-service authorization stays where augment-it put it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017HuzSPdPK4QEhs7eztHgoC","tree":{"sha":"29fcbe7817f8f5ce8553806269f49734476120f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/29fcbe7817f8f5ce8553806269f49734476120f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDQ1ZmQzZGY2ZWJiMDY1NDZmMzJmZDBkMmUwMmQyY2ZhNTdjY2ViMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32","sha":"348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32"}],"sha":"45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/45fd3df6ebb06546f32fd0d2e02d2cfa57cceb37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:33:38Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T21:33:38Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"explore(context-v): consumer 1 shipped — didi.sh identity gets its evidence, its scars, and a closed local-auth question\n\nSeven weeks after this exploration proposed a shared identity plane, augment-it\nis running on it: id.didi.sh on Fly, augment.didi.sh on Railway, one instance\nserving humain.vc and reach.edu since 2026-07-28. The headless contract held —\nthe identity service owns no pixels, and augment-it''s sign-in wall and account\nbadge call five small endpoints directly. Two of the doc''s open questions are\nanswered by the fact of it (the subdomain is id.didi.sh; the person id shipped\nas didi_id), so they are struck rather than left inviting re-litigation.\n\nThe more useful half is the five scars. An empty CORS allowlist in prod made\nevery cross-origin call fail silently, which is now the first thing any new\nconsumer must fix rather than rediscover. The cookie''s Domain=.didi.sh scope is\nrecorded as a hard topology constraint rather than a detail. Sessions expiring\nmid-flight produced a zombie UI. PUBLIC_* config bakes at build time — the\nproperty that just cost a production outage on PUBLIC_WS_URL, generalised here\ninto \"resolve shared endpoints in one module, never as a literal per surface.\"\nAnd local dev needs a token-echo escape hatch, one-shot per tab, because the\nnaive version loops forever.\n\nThe local-auth question is closed on an asymmetry rather than a preference: we\nmaintain didi.sh for augment-it regardless, so adopting costs wiring while\ndeclining costs another auth system to secure and migrate forever. The survey\nthat makes it concrete found dididecks already carrying THREE divergent local\nimplementations — calmstorm-decks, chroma-decks, eventcut-ai, each with its own\nlib/auth, schema, and invite script — while memopop carries none at all across\nits four apps. The predicted drift arrived on schedule in one repo and hasn''t\nstarted in the other, which is why memopop is the easy wiring job and dididecks\nis a migration.\n\nThat migration forks on a question this doc refuses to answer for the reader:\ndeck viewers are a different population from operators, and a passcode handed\nto a room of LPs is a deliberately low-assurance affordance. Authoring migrates\ncleanly; whether viewing should is Q8, and Q10 depends on it. Q9 names the gap\naugment-it never hit — memopop-orchestrator is a headless Python agent with no\nbrowser and no user session, and the identity spec has no story for machine\ncredentials yet.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017HuzSPdPK4QEhs7eztHgoC","tree":{"sha":"9d0d450c97312866ec40218e2fbebc3585d8ba0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/9d0d450c97312866ec40218e2fbebc3585d8ba0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDM0OGYxMzNmMjAwNGM3OGJhOTI5YWI4YjNhMWNmZTYzNTUxZWVlMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7","sha":"392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7"}],"sha":"348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/348f133f2004c78ba929ab8b3a1cfe63551eee32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:17:34Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:17:34Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"bump(submodule): id-didi-sh — the UTC-dates reminder\n\nFollows 6c218b3, which could not include this because the reminder was written\nafter that bump landed.\n\nid-didi-sh 513dc3c -> d2fbe5b. One commit: the context-v reminder recording\nthat dates are UTC at rest and viewer-local at render, so a build-time format\nnever bakes the build machine''s timezone into what every reader sees.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LS6Z98mLjukzQpyZbX19cA","tree":{"sha":"9e69d077f12e72e217ea722b49d76e72b8640b00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/9e69d077f12e72e217ea722b49d76e72b8640b00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDM5MmMwOTliYjMwZmU1MDQ2NzFlODllNGE0MzYzNTU4N2VkMmZhZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/6c218b3d04feae6844f4303f7c4cdb43df8c7b25","sha":"6c218b3d04feae6844f4303f7c4cdb43df8c7b25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/6c218b3d04feae6844f4303f7c4cdb43df8c7b25"}],"sha":"392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/392c099bb30fe504671e89e4a43635587ed2fae7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/6c218b3d04feae6844f4303f7c4cdb43df8c7b25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:13:40Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T17:13:40Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"bump(submodules): id-didi-sh, flave-ai, context-vigilance-kit\n\nThree gitlinks in one commit rather than three. All targets verified clean and\npushed to their own remotes before pinning.\n\nid-didi-sh 8af9992 -> 513dc3c (32 commits). The entities, credentials and\nlending spike promoted to main: flat entity model, credentials encrypted at\nrest, lending cascades, the app-only resolve path, the lender''s LiveView, and\nthe JS bundle fix that had been silently failing since July. Suite 101 green.\nAlso today''s documentation work — the DESIGN.md files corrected from augment-it\nto didi.sh, the splash interlinking fix, two changelog entries, and the July\nfrontmatter sweep with its splash loader.\n\nThis repoint is a prerequisite, not a courtesy. The parent was pinned to\n8af9992, which is the TIP of id-didi-sh''s hygene/test-coverage branch and is\nnot reachable from main. Deleting that branch while the pin stood would have\norphaned the commit the parent points at. The two commits the old pin carried\nthat main does not are already extracted by file, so no content is lost —\nonly the commits.\n\nflave-ai c4e8a95 -> ebd945f (8 commits). Work from the linux machine: flave\nbecomes a Tauri desktop app, the theme becomes a file you can open, the render\nloop and trigger-packs land, callouts and tables become real components, and\nfifteen ideas get captured and costed. Was on a development branch main had\nnever seen.\n\ncontext-vigilance-kit b3b3b3a -> fb07401 (1 commit). The knowledge graph gets\na face, and local graphiti extraction becomes survivable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LS6Z98mLjukzQpyZbX19cA","tree":{"sha":"75e13de1ead6291582b78fd385b8d9b0178e1b37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/75e13de1ead6291582b78fd385b8d9b0178e1b37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/6c218b3d04feae6844f4303f7c4cdb43df8c7b25","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722