m/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/af585b5a2011d44d4d9506d23e1dcd689f052473/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:20:25Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T21:20:25Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"new(rollup-sync): gate the public rollup on repository visibility, failing closed\n\nRoot-cause fix for the client-data exposure contained in 48681cd. Without this,\nthe next `rollup:sync` would have republished everything that commit removed.\n\nThe rollup previously took any file carrying `publish != false`. That flag is\nthe wrong control at this boundary: it is set by whoever authored the entry,\nfor THEIR repo''s surface. A private client repo can legitimately mark every\nentry `publish: true` meaning \"publish on the client''s gated site\" — and this\nscript read that as consent to put it on a public GitHub Pages site.\n\nTwo independent gates now run before anything is copied, because neither is\nsufficient alone:\n\n1. CONTAINER RULE — anything discovered under `client-sites/` is excluded\n   structurally. This is the load-bearing one. `reach-edu-hub` is a PUBLIC repo\n   and still a named client engagement, so a visibility check alone would have\n   let it through. \"Private\" and \"confidential\" are different properties. A\n   client site added next month is denied without anyone updating a list.\n\n2. VISIBILITY AUTO-DETECT — an UNAUTHENTICATED call to api.github.com. A public\n   repo returns 200; a private one returns 404, because an anonymous caller\n   cannot see it at all. Deliberately unauthenticated: an authenticated call\n   would succeed against private repos and defeat the purpose. Verified against\n   chroma-decks and calmstorm-decks, both of which return 404 anonymously and\n   would be excluded even with the container rule removed.\n\nPlus an explicit DENYLIST as belt and braces, overriding both.\n\nFAILS CLOSED throughout. Anything not provably public — private, missing,\nrenamed, no git remote, network error — is excluded and logged with a reason. A\nrollup missing a repo is cosmetic; a rollup that leaks one is not.\n\nResult: 7 of 23 sources excluded, all seven client engagements. The regenerated\nrollup carries no fundraise figures, no lead investor, no runway, no ASP. Splash\nbuilds at 712 pages.\n\nThree residual AIX Ventures / Bloomberg Beta mentions remain and are\ndeliberate — they use a public firm''s public team page as a crawl test target,\nwhich discloses nothing about who funds whom. The passages that linked firms to\na client''s raise were genericized in their originals.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AiuLqnWLSAxzm2Ry1mcV7p","tree":{"sha":"359f2944f63184b1ab43864e0fb1d2199b4ba00b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/359f2944f63184b1ab43864e0fb1d2199b4ba00b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/af585b5a2011d44d4d9506d23e1dcd689f052473","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/af585b5a2011d44d4d9506d23e1dcd689f052473","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGFmNTg1YjVhMjAxMWQ0NGQ0ZDk1MDZkMjNlMWRjZDY4OWYwNTI0NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6","sha":"48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6"}],"sha":"af585b5a2011d44d4d9506d23e1dcd689f052473","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/af585b5a2011d44d4d9506d23e1dcd689f052473"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:52:53Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T20:52:53Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(splash): remove client-engagement content from the public rollup\n\nURGENT containment. This repo is public (github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs)\nand its splash deploys to GitHub Pages, so everything committed under\nsplash/src/rollup/ is world-readable and rendered.\n\nThe rollup was carrying 306 files from seven named client engagements. Verified\nlive before this commit: the page at\n/changelog/dididecks-ai/chroma-decks/2026-05-12_01/ returned HTTP 200 and\nrendered a client''s confidential fundraise position — named lead investor, cash\non hand, months of runway, enterprise ASP, and a forward run-rate target.\n\nRemoved from the rollup: chroma-decks, calmstorm-decks, reach-edu-hub,\neventcut-ai, humain-vc-decks, lossless-decks, and the-water-foundation. Named\nclient work does not belong on a public splash regardless of the `publish` flag\non any individual entry.\n\nRoot cause worth fixing separately: rollup-sync.ts has no exclude mechanism. It\nwalks the submodule tree and takes whatever carries publish != false, so a\nclient repo''s entries qualify simply by existing. The `publish` gate is the\nwrong control here — those entries were legitimately `publish: true` for the\nclient''s own internal site. The rollup needs a repo-level denylist so this\ncannot recur on the next sync.\n\nThis stops the live exposure. It does NOT remove the content from git history,\nwhich is a separate and destructive operation, and the operator''s call.\n\nThree parent-level dididecks-ai files still name the client''s lead investor in\npassing (a \"Backed by\" slot description and two changelog asides). Left in place\nand flagged rather than removed unilaterally — they disclose an investor\nrelationship, not the financial position.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AiuLqnWLSAxzm2Ry1mcV7p","tree":{"sha":"393b934a9d875e085469694bdc5f4ae310ffa390","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/393b934a9d875e085469694bdc5f4ae310ffa390"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDQ4NjgxY2RhYmNmMDE4OGUwNmJlZWY0NDIyZjJmMGZmNGMzMzcxYjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855","sha":"06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855"}],"sha":"48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/48681cdabcf0188e06beef4422f2f0ff4c3371b6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:54:42Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T18:54:42Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(splash): teach the date chains the editorial keys\n\nEvery date chain in this splash resolved through\n\n    date_modified ?? date_created ?? date\n\nwhich predates the editorial convention and never mentions\ndate_authored_initial_draft / date_authored_current_draft. The frontmatter\nsweep has been retiring the legacy `date:` key across the tree, and where an\nentry had no date_created to fall back on it is now resolvable ONLY through\nthe editorial pair — so a stale chain renders it dateless and sorts it as\nepoch-zero, with no error to announce it.\n\nThe editorial keys are appended LAST, so existing precedence is untouched:\nanything carrying date_modified still resolves to date_modified. Only entries\nthat previously resolved to nothing change behaviour.\n\nConfirmed live on the lossless-agent-skills splash before this pass, where the\nnewest changelog entry was rendering at the bottom of the list.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AiuLqnWLSAxzm2Ry1mcV7p","tree":{"sha":"ef7b4cc6c4993262f0e16a5ac5964c64022f56d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/ef7b4cc6c4993262f0e16a5ac5964c64022f56d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDA2YWZhNjkyODVkZDQ1ZjMxYWM3N2RhODI3Y2YzYzk3NzJhMDc4NTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f","sha":"8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f"}],"sha":"06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/06afa69285dd45f31ac77da827cf3c9772a07855"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:13:39Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T17:13:39Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"fix(frontmatter): editorial date pair and identity across all 13 changelog entries\n\nOne rename from the legacy `date:` key, twelve derived from `date_created`,\nall thirteen given `site_uuid` and `hex_code`.\n\nThis repo was found by the final tree-wide verification rather than by the\nplan. The per-repo sweep walked the children and stepped past the parent\npseudomonorepo''s own changelog — a reminder that the audit''s repo list and the\norder work actually gets done in can drift apart, and that the closing check\nis what reconciles them.\n\nWith this, the legacy `date:` key is retired from every changelog frontmatter\nin the tree. The only surviving occurrence is inside a fenced documentation\nexample in banner-site, which is body text and correctly left alone.\n\nStaged path-scoped: .gitignore, studies/CLAUDE.md, and ten moved submodule\npointers were already dirty and are deliberately excluded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AiuLqnWLSAxzm2Ry1mcV7p","tree":{"sha":"e533bbc2c6655738c122cb5c94d808db81a65e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/e533bbc2c6655738c122cb5c94d808db81a65e63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDgwNTU4MDhjODVmM2Q4ODcyMjBjYjAwMDM3ZjZiMmI0NjE5M2U2OGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22","sha":"c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22"}],"sha":"8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/8055808c85f3d887220cb00037f6b2b46193e68f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T05:52:11Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T05:52:11Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"doc(context-v): land three documents from prior sessions — identity amendment, cross-app issue, deal-coverage plan\n\nThree pieces of parent-level context that were authored in earlier sessions and\nnever committed. Recorded here as-authored; none were edited in this session.\n\nThe identity spec gains an amendment dated 2026-08-09 that supersedes its\n\"authorization state stays in the services\" position. The old model held while\norgs were the only tenancy notion and each consumer mapped org-roles onto its\nown resources. It does not survive how the operator actually works: the people\nwho most need access to a client''s workspace — fractional operators, advisors,\ninvestors, agencies, whoever is administering it from another company''s address\n— are precisely the ones whose email will never match its domain. Derive\nmembership from a domain and you have built a system that structurally cannot\nexpress an advisor.\n\nFour rulings follow: the workspace becomes the tenancy boundary and the thing\nsecrets attach to; membership is explicit and email-domain-independent; a domain\nis demoted to a self-signup convenience on the workspace rather than an identity;\nand organizations survive in reduced form.\n\nThe State-Inspector issue promotes a finding from augment-it to the parent,\nbecause it is not an augment-it problem. augment-it''s rune singletons plus\nlocalStorage plus WS frames, dididecks'' deck/variant/theme state, and memopop''s\nLangGraph FlowState are all invisible to the people operating them. Per the\nno-shared-dependency rule it travels as a blueprint each app implements\nnatively rather than as a package.\n\nThe Quick-Slides plan is at v0.0.0.2 and partially shipped — stages 0 through 3\nran against 9 deals in lossless-decks; stage 4 was reduced to a filmstrip plus\nPDF link with the full play-from-PDF UI deferred.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FXejPyq3ovF3XrkMGSAwJM","tree":{"sha":"ab53f3f503515333ac0269702d34fb97db679497","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/ab53f3f503515333ac0269702d34fb97db679497"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGMxMjZkMjQ0ZGNhNTEwZTljZTQ0ZGE2ZWQ1ZTYyYzcwMzQ3ZWZhMjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752","sha":"bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752"}],"sha":"c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/c126d244dca510e9ce44da6ed5e62c70347efa22"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-15T05:46:03Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-15T05:46:03Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"add(submodule): flave joins the labs; splash rollup catches up and finally names didi.sh\n\nflave enters as `flave-ai/` tracking lossless-group/flave on main. It answers a\nquestion none of its siblings ask: what should a document be, now that agents\nwrite most of them. MemoPop generates memos and DidiDecks generates decks; both\nproduce artifacts and hand them off. flave is about the artifact itself.\n\nThe differentiator that survived a day of grilling was not agent-legibility but\nthe private layer — a document that keeps its workings. Content, data, and\nassets each carry a clearance (private through public) and a register, so one\nfile yields your private notes, the team version, the LP version, and a punchy\npublic one-pager, none of which drift. Clearance is monotonic, which makes the\npromise machine-checkable rather than merely intended.\n\nIt arrives pre-implementation, carrying a ~24,000-word master spec with 20\ndecisions resolved on the record, 12 open, and 11 considerations parked. The\nbuild order is deliberately tiny: v0 is an editor and nothing else.\n\nThe splash gains two things. flave joins the rollup as the eighth child — slug\n`flave`, dir `flave-ai`, the slug/dir split earning its keep. And the product\nhighlights, static at four entries since they were built, finally name didi.sh;\nthe identity plane has been live on Fly since July and was invisible on our own\nshowcase.\n\nThe rollup re-sync is larger than the flave addition alone because it had gone\nstale: children have since gained date_authored_* frontmatter, and two\ndididecks sub-children (eventcut-ai, the-water-foundation) had never been\npicked up. 367 files of that catch-up ride along here rather than being left\nhalf-synced, since the rollup''s whole job is to mirror the children.\n\nDeliberately left unstaged: the other submodule pointer moves, .gitignore, the\nId-Didi-Sh spec edit, and two untracked context-v files. None are related to\nthis change and each deserves its own commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FXejPyq3ovF3XrkMGSAwJM","tree":{"sha":"1db6976887de0eb4b31b4672c8b1cc3dde909aa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/1db6976887de0eb4b31b4672c8b1cc3dde909aa8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGJiZjBmMTJhODZjNTIzM2NhNTk2ZGRmYjUyYWFiNzY4M2ZjMTc3NTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52","sha":"186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52"}],"sha":"bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/bbf0f12a86c5233ca596ddfb52aab7683fc17752"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:43:11Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:43:11Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"new(plan): didi.sh login and workspace-delivered config — the workspace holds the secrets\n\ncorpora-builder should log in through id.didi.sh and get its configuration,\nincluding R2 credentials, from the workspace rather than a local .env. Login is\nan integration against something already running; config from the workspace is a\nnew contract.\n\nThree findings shaped it, two of them corrections.\n\nid.didi.sh is LIVE — JWKS returns 200, /api/me correctly 401s. The repo README\nstill shows increment 5 \"Deploy\" unchecked, so planning against that checklist\nrather than the running service would have produced a wrong plan.\n\nThe draft offered org-keyed config versus workspace-first. The operator removed\nthe choice with ground truth rather than preference: accounts created for\npalmer-ai under a human.vc address, many organizations supported sometimes with\ntheir email and sometimes not, often as admin. And the general case — \"every\nstartup you end up with service providers, advisors, investors.\" Derive\nmembership from an email domain and you have built a system that structurally\ncannot express an advisor. So the workspace becomes the tenancy AND secret\nboundary, membership is explicit and domain-independent, and a domain is demoted\nto a self-signup convenience. Orgs survive for grouping and billing. This is the\nshape Slack, Notion and Linear each converged on for the same reason.\n\nAnd secretspec was never installed — only its manifest format adopted, which the\noperator flagged and which `command -v` confirms. It is now presented as a real\nchoice with the honest for-and-against, leaning skip-it-here: corpora will have\nexactly one secret source, and one source does not need a multi-provider\nabstraction. The self-host stacks, with three clients across Railway and .env and\ndidi, are where it would actually pay.\n\nThe security tension is real and resolvable. \"Serve env vars from didi\" reads as\nthe opposite of the capability thesis — secret values must not be the thing we\ndistribute. R2''s Temporary Credentials API dissolves it: the parent token stays\non didi, and what reaches a laptop is scoped to one bucket and prefix and expires\nin minutes. Today corpora-builder/.env holds a key that can read and write the\nwhole reach-edu bucket forever, with no audit trail.\n\nPhase A is spec amendment with no code, and is gated on sign-off.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RVKJ5DX2MA2zYtZTVqvnKn","tree":{"sha":"f620505ca11c5800bc9b6db41187b96d11fbed40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/f620505ca11c5800bc9b6db41187b96d11fbed40"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDE4NmYzYjJjZjFkMDZhM2NlMTZkZDliYjM4ZTU1OTNkYmIwNDRhNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab","sha":"4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab"}],"sha":"186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/186f3b2cf1d06a3ce16dd9bb38e5593dbb044a52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:47:15Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T22:47:15Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"doc(CLAUDE.md): browser-drive verification block\n\nCompletes a tree-wide rollout that was left half-committed: augment-it\nhad its copy committed, several siblings did not. The block documents the\ntwo-tier browser-drive convention — Playwright MCP as the codified\ndefault, `claude --chrome` for watched interactive runs — plus the rules\nthat keep it cheap and safe: accessibility snapshots over screenshots,\nwrites only against a designated safe target, the click-path named in the\nphase plan before implementation, and the reminder that a browser drive\nproves the buttons work while the human walk-through still judges whether\nthe surface is usable.\n\nPure addition, no deletions. Wrapped in the `lossless:browser-drive`\nsentinel so the insert stays idempotent across repos.\n\nCommitted on its own rather than folded into adjacent feature work — a\nconvention rollout that spans repos should be greppable as one thing, not\nburied under a commit header about something else.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RPW1x7A9HJBENLVYyQH9sj","tree":{"sha":"2f51c684d9548a9fa1ff6b8e08fc12679d80ab0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/2f51c684d9548a9fa1ff6b8e08fc12679d80ab0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDQwNzRiY2Y0NmEzMjc2NWJiZTczYzYxMjE1NmM3M2EyOGMyNjIyYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1","sha":"290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1"}],"sha":"4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/4074bcf46a32765bbe73c612156c73a28c2622ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:47:17Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-25T05:47:17Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"add(context-v): Secrets-for-Collaborators exploration, now carrying the first connector-matrix finding\n\nThe terminal-poor collaborator exploration (v0.0.0.6) lands in git for the\nfirst time, including tonight''s Findings entry: Claude Desktop completed\nthe full OAuth dance against a self-hosted Twenty MCP endpoint — dynamic\nclient registration, PKCE login, tool calls as the logged-in user. The\nTRUST_PROXY http-metadata blocker, the per-tool allow-prompt friction, and\nthe dead-connector-entry UX wrinkle are recorded verbatim for the\ncapability-plane design.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QjDRxzdy8xhYJCsEgRfEgd","tree":{"sha":"7e307eeefb3e8d5916a761e708e7b2235bd3070b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/7e307eeefb3e8d5916a761e708e7b2235bd3070b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDI5MDkzOGQ0ZTczZjA2ZjViYTc0MmQ5ZmRiYmYwYWI4ODg4OTNhYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a","sha":"83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a"}],"sha":"290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/290938d4e73f06f5ba742d9fdbbf0ab888893ac1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:36:29Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-21T20:36:29Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"update(splash), bump(submodules): roll up all 7 children — corpora-builder, id-didi-sh, studies join the splash\n\nThe splash rollup was frozen at four children while the tree grew to\nseven. Anyone landing on the splash — including the collaborator the\ntree is being opened to — saw no trace of corpora-builder, id-didi-sh,\nthe five studies, or the dididecks-ai client-sites family. The rollup\nnow carries all of them: 268 changelog files and 525 context-v files\nfrom 20 sources.\n\nrollup-sync.ts gains container-aware sub-child discovery: each child\ncan declare which subdirs to scan for sub-projects instead of the\nhardcoded apps/. dididecks-ai scans apps/ + client-sites/ (five deck\nworkspaces), studies scans its own direct children (five sub-studies).\nAnything with a changelog/ or context-v/ becomes a sub-child with\nfrom/from_path provenance, as before.\n\nVerified with pnpm rollup:sync + pnpm build: 733 pages, Pagefind index\nincluded, every new source present on the /context-v/ index.\n\nAlso included: submodule pointers advanced to pushed tips (augment-it,\ncontext-vigilance-kit with today''s corpus refresh, corpora-builder, and\ntwo studies); changelog/2026-07-21_01.md ship note.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DcYMsmGFQz3i7RjqCHhKxD","tree":{"sha":"cfdeb7a8b6ff675ac515fa11eb91b95f0807eb99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/cfdeb7a8b6ff675ac515fa11eb91b95f0807eb99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKDgzNDY4ODg2ZDAxMjhmYTI2Yjg3Y2U5Njc5ZWYxZWNmZjQwOTczOGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/ec5d3303749e7b5f8d103192a8fd9bc3f316be4e","sha":"ec5d3303749e7b5f8d103192a8fd9bc3f316be4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ec5d3303749e7b5f8d103192a8fd9bc3f316be4e"}],"sha":"83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/83468886d0128fa26b87ce9679ef1ecff409738a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/ec5d3303749e7b5f8d103192a8fd9bc3f316be4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T22:40:36Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T22:40:36Z","email":"mpstaton@gmail.com","name":"mpstaton"},"message":"new(corpora-builder): mount the corpus-building system as a child submodule\n\nCorpus assembly has recurred as a sub-feature across augment-it, memopop-ai,\nand dididecks-ai; corpora-builder graduates the pattern into its own project.\nRegistered tracking main to match the parent''s current tier, with development\nand master pushed at the same commit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PA9J2hwxjdiBHdPKzTr5of","tree":{"sha":"31f9591fdf018017c6aeaf1e8dc77b13d0084a3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/trees/31f9591fdf018017c6aeaf1e8dc77b13d0084a3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/git/commits/ec5d3303749e7b5f8d103192a8fd9bc3f316be4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5722?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mpstaton","id":5722,"login":"mpstaton","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3MjI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mpstaton","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/ec5d3303749e7b5f8d103192a8fd9bc3f316be4e","node_id":"C_kwDOOMvWKtoAKGVjNWQzMzAzNzQ5ZTdiNWY4ZDEwMzE5MmE4ZmQ5YmMzZjMxNmJlNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commit/f023b30e80187646f163716da2552ba2daa14a26","sha":"f023b30e80187646f163716da2552ba2daa14a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lossless-group/lossless-ai-labs/commits/f023b30e80187646f163716da2552ba2daa14a26"}],"sha":"ec5d3303749e7b