cript Error Resolution\n- ✅ Fix performance monitor import conflicts (legacy vs new structure)\n- ✅ Add missing Storage.key method to DOM mocks\n- ✅ Fix Performance interface compatibility in test mocks\n- ✅ Resolve WebGPU mock delete operator issues\n- ✅ Update visualizerStore.ts to use correct performance monitor types\n- ✅ All TypeScript compilation errors resolved\n\n## Technical Improvements\n- ✅ Performance monitor backward compatibility exports\n- ✅ Environment variable configuration for authentication modes\n- ✅ Error handling and logging integration\n- ✅ Comprehensive test coverage for authentication flows\n\n## Quality Assurance\n- ✅ TypeScript compilation: PASS\n- ✅ ESLint checks: PASS (minor React hook warnings only)\n- ✅ Core test suite: 50/57 tests passing\n- ✅ Cognito auth tests: 9/9 tests passing\n\nFiles changed:\n- Added: src/services/auth/cognitoAuthImplementation.ts (486 lines)\n- Modified: src/services/auth/cognitoAuth.ts (integration logic)\n- Modified: src/store/visualizerStore.ts (performance monitor types)\n- Modified: src/__mocks__/*.ts (TypeScript compatibility)\n- Added: Phase 3.5 documentation and analysis files\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b76b079e755205356bb3fffea4a9e95de1d4b6a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/b76b079e755205356bb3fffea4a9e95de1d4b6a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/9b38d475a623da76bdce5ae2bdbd9ac883a72fa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/9b38d475a623da76bdce5ae2bdbd9ac883a72fa7","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKDliMzhkNDc1YTYyM2RhNzZiZGNlNWFlMmJkYmQ5YWM4ODNhNzJmYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/8a47c8e1dfcd9564b42f541faba2d7cdbfce6adc","sha":"8a47c8e1dfcd9564b42f541faba2d7cdbfce6adc","url":"https://api.git