3R with enterprise-grade code quality standards and development workflows.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6b0ee9648dcee26dd21488ea6dacf22b01abbbb3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/6b0ee9648dcee26dd21488ea6dacf22b01abbbb3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/b71a4df5ba0313ae228b5022d54f0a7eca93a19a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/b71a4df5ba0313ae228b5022d54f0a7eca93a19a","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKGI3MWE0ZGY1YmEwMzEzYWUyMjhiNTAyMmQ1NGYwYTdlY2E5M2ExOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b","sha":"a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b"}],"sha":"b71a4df5ba0313ae228b5022d54f0a7eca93a19a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/b71a4df5ba0313ae228b5022d54f0a7eca93a19a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T23:05:44Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-11-138.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T23:05:44Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-11-138.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"message":"feat: Complete Phase 2 - Major structural improvements and test stabilization\n\n🚀 PHASE 2 MAJOR MILESTONE ACHIEVED\n\n## ✅ Structural Improvements Completed\n- ✅ **UI Components Unification**: 100% complete (eliminated all duplicates)\n- ✅ **Integration Tests**: 100% success rate (13/13 tests passing)\n- ✅ **AudioContext Mock Issues**: Resolved completely\n- ✅ **Module Architecture**: Fully unified to @vj-app/*