gress Toward Production Readiness\n- **Phase 1**: Emergency fixes ✅ COMPLETE\n- **Phase 2**: Structural improvements ✅ COMPLETE\n- **Phase 3**: Quality & performance improvements → IN PROGRESS\n- **Target**: 95%+ test success rate (currently 85%+)\n\nThis represents fundamental architectural improvements that establish V1Z3R\nas a truly modular, maintainable, and production-ready application.\n\nNext: Phase 3 - Quality enhancement, linting, formatting, and performance optimization\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5424bc7cecefdcec9c6ff6bcd6d634e4d0a8ffce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/5424bc7cecefdcec9c6ff6bcd6d634e4d0a8ffce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKGE3ZmE4MmY0M2IyNmQ4NDA3MWYwZmE3Y2ZkN2E3NzQwNmJlNWJmOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/c5534feaeb6ac0379da6ad1f6ec2bb1960eafe25","sha":"c5534feaeb6ac0379da6ad1f6ec2bb1960eafe25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/c5534feaeb6ac0379da6ad1f6ec2bb1960eafe25"}],"sha":"a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/a7fa82f43b26d84071f0fa7cfd7a77406be5bf8b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/c5534feaeb6ac0379da6ad1f6ec2bb1960eafe25/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T23:02:23Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-11-138.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T23:02:23Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-11-138.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"message":"feat