"ec2-user@ip-172-31-21-229.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-28T22:39:35Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-21-229.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"message":"fix: Add --passWithNoTests to module test scripts and improve ESLint comments\n\n### Copilot Review Response\n- Added descriptive ESLint disable comments to AudioAnalyzer and MIDIAnalyzer\n- Explained why dependencies are intentionally omitted to prevent infinite loops\n\n### Module Test Fix\n- Added `--passWithNoTests` flag to Jest commands in all module package.json files\n- Prevents CI failure when modules don''t have test files yet\n- Affected modules: visual-renderer, vj-controller, sync-core, preset-storage\n\n### Test Results\n✅ **Module tests now pass (4/4)**:\n- @vj-app/visual-renderer: No tests found, exit code 0 ✓\n- @vj-app/vj-controller: 19 tests passed ✓\n- @vj-app/sync-core: No tests found, exit code 0 ✓\n- @vj-app/preset-storage: No tests found, exit code 0 ✓\n\nThis fixes the CI/CD pipeline failure in Optimized CI/CD workflow.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"568c300b234f1f66be487ff608a759a344831c1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/568c300b234f1f66be487ff608a759a344831c1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/e976f9e40ad2e1f512219edb71af7b1914d19aba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/e976f9e40ad2e1f512219edb71af7b1914d19aba","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKGU5NzZmOWU0MGFkMmUxZjUxMjIxOWVkYjcxYWY3YjE5MTRkMTlhYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57","sha":"9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57"}],"sha":"e976f9e40ad2e1f512219edb71af7b1914d19aba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/e976f9e40ad2e1f512219edb71af7b1914d19aba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-28T22:32:21Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-21-229.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-28T22:32:21Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-21-229.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"message":"fix: E2E tests - Fix URL routing and React infinite loops\n\nFixed multiple issues preventing E2E tests from passing:\n\n1. **URL Routing Fix**: Changed E2E tests to navigate to `/vj-app` instead of `/`\n   - E2E tests were accessing homepage instead of VJ application\n   - All tests now properly access the VJ application interface\n\n2. **React Infinite Loop Fixes**:\n   - **AudioAnalyzer.tsx**: Removed `startAnalyzing` and `stopAnalyzing` from useEffect dependencies\n   - **MIDIAnalyzer.tsx**: Removed `startMIDI` and `stopMIDI` from useEffect dependencies\n   - Added ESLint disable comments to suppress dependency warnings (intentional)\n\n3. **Test Results**: All 7 E2E tests now pass (100% success rate)\n   - should load the main VJ interface ✓\n   - should handle microphone permissions gracefully ✓\n   - should allow switching between visual effect types ✓\n   - should support preset management ✓\n   - should be responsive on mobile devices ✓\n   - should handle errors gracefully ✓\n   - should maintain performance standards ✓\n\nThe infinite loops were caused by including memoized callback functions in useEffect dependency arrays, which caused setState calls to trigger the useEffect repeatedly.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"19c4b9deb38fb6a4a1080459c192ca332cd3d53f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/19c4b9deb38fb6a4a1080459c192ca332cd3d53f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKDllM2E1N2JmOThlMTBlOGVmNWZhYmZjZWEyNTY1MDdhODEwMzJmNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/07e447b0b9c06331a86d15cd4233bb11dac96454","sha":"07e447b0b9c06331a86d15cd4233bb11dac96454","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/07e447b0b9c06331a86d15cd4233bb11dac96454"}],"sha":"9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/9e3a57bf98e10e8ef5fabfcea256507a81032f57"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1693436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/20m61","id":1693436,"login":"20m61","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTM0MzY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/07e447b0b9c06331a86d15cd4233bb11dac96454/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-28T21:59:46Z","email":"ifm0s1m0s1m0nn