dd performance optimizations with named volumes for node_modules and caches\n- Include comprehensive test script for configuration validation\n- Update CLAUDE.md with devcontainer documentation\n\nFeatures:\n- Node.js 20 base with essential development tools\n- Pre-configured VS Code extensions (ESLint, Prettier, TypeScript, etc.)\n- Optional services: Redis for caching, PostgreSQL for future DB needs\n- Security: Non-root user, restricted network access, minimal capabilities\n- Performance: Cached bind mounts, separate volumes for dependencies\n\nFiles added:\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json\n- .devcontainer/docker-compose.yml\n- .devcontainer/Dockerfile\n- .devcontainer/init-firewall.sh\n- .devcontainer/test-devcontainer.sh\n- .devcontainer/.env.devcontainer\n- .devcontainer/README.md\n- docs/DEVCONTAINER_SETUP_2025.md\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a75cab6acd9a89a0b22249d6b4388325c3ce1fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/8a75cab6acd9a89a0b22249d6b4388325c3ce1fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/f6949bfcccad0a13e6039ed00b7b7722f0ff00d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/f6949bfcccad0a13e6039ed00b7b7722f0ff00d2","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKGY2OTQ5YmZjY2NhZDBhMTNlNjAzOWVkMDBiN2I3NzIyZjBmZjAwZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/4bfb9c9ca0ef55a22ed1a178aa08695e45ecb569","sha":"4bfb9c9ca0ef55a22ed1a178aa08695e45ecb569","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/4bfb9c9ca0ef55a22ed1a178aa08695e45ecb569"}],"sha":"f6949bfcccad0a13e6039ed00b7b7722f0ff00d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/f6949bfcccad0a13e6039ed00b7b7722f0ff00d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1693436?v=4","events_url":"https: