n✅ Project structure analysis (monorepo with 7 modules)\n✅ Feature inventory (19 pages, 16+ components, 25+ utilities)\n✅ Architecture documentation (Next.js + AWS CDK + WebGPU)\n✅ Quality assessment (testing, performance, security)\n✅ Issue identification (3 critical, 7 high, 5 medium priority)\n✅ Workflow documentation (CI/CD, development, deployment)\n✅ Actionable recommendations (4-phase improvement plan)\n\n## Recommended Immediate Actions:\n1. Restore GitHub Actions CI/CD pipeline\n2. Stabilize failing tests (40/1,060 currently failing)\n3. Fix TypeScript compilation issues in LayerManager.tsx\n4. Implement 4-phase improvement plan\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1aef0606c0d9c30605d238914402228754b5ab22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/1aef0606c0d9c30605d238914402228754b5ab22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/131524d6ef0fea9a8ca0d7c375420f81c8ad147a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/131524d6ef0fea9a8ca0d7c375420f81c8ad147a","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKDEzMTUyNGQ2ZWYwZmVhOWE4Y2EwZDdjMzc1NDIwZjgxYzhhZDE0N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/1c736a329b190d1fee0dadf1f6336aa0fb077752","sha":"1c736a329b190d1fee0dadf1f6336aa0fb077752","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/1c736a329b190d1fee0dadf1f6336aa0fb077752"}],"sha":"131524d6ef0fea9a8ca0d7c375420f81c8ad147a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/131524d6ef0fea9a8ca0d7c375420f81c8ad147a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1693436?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/20m61/following{/other_user}","gi