ponents fixes\n\n**UI Components Fixes:**\n- Fix Button/Slider/ColorPicker default exports in modules/ui-components\n- Resolve 60+ TypeScript JSX component type errors across the codebase\n- Ensure consistent named and default export patterns\n\n**Mobile Performance Monitoring:**\n- Add 11 mobile-specific metrics: device memory, battery level, touch response, orientation change\n- Implement real-time FPS monitoring with target vs actual comparison\n- Add OffscreenCanvas fallback detection for iOS Safari compatibility\n- Integrate memory pressure detection and mobile optimization level assessment\n\n**Performance Integration:**\n- Initialize mobile metrics in VJApplication on startup\n- Track real-time performance gaps between target and actual FPS\n- Monitor OffscreenCanvas fallback usage for Safari compatibility\n\n**Key Improvements:**\n- Enhanced iPhone console error reduction through targeted logging\n- Automatic mobile device detection and optimization level determination\n- Battery-aware performance scaling for better mobile experience\n- Touch response time monitoring for UI responsiveness metrics\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26104fa55c4fb68c1c265f710b230dde51460ea6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/26104fa55c4fb68c1c265f710b230dde51460ea6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/91d50df0e4ddbaff7c2d62d23dde409079987aaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/91d50df0e4ddbaff7c2d62d23dde409079987aaf","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKDkxZDUwZGYwZTRkZGJhZmY3YzJkNjJkMjNkZGU0MDkwNzk5ODdhYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/96589934f39671b2d3b6dad7c8a249eb4a8817c3","sha":"96589934f39671b2d3b6dad7c8a249eb4a8817c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/965