Docker Configuration Corrections\n- Fixed Docker Compose context paths to correctly reference project root\n- Updated build context from `.` to `../..`\n- Updated volume mounts from `.` to `../..`\n- Removed obsolete `version: ''3.8''` from compose files\n\n### 3. Validation\n- [x] Docker Compose configurations now validate correctly\n- [x] ESLint passes ✅\n- [x] TypeScript type check passes ✅\n\nThese fixes ensure all moved files are correctly referenced and Docker builds will work from the new tools/docker/ location.","tree":{"sha":"e5575b68e088d89c5bdab79c43016d1773c8a69f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/e5575b68e088d89c5bdab79c43016d1773c8a69f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/ee55a7f19f0573b95792b56c8bdef70807267225","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/ee55a7f19f0573b95792b56c8bdef70807267225","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKGVlNTVhN2YxOWYwNTczYjk1NzkyYjU2YzhiZGVmNzA4MDcyNjcyMjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/436579acebca75ccb9be17c962528d5ced918c63","sha":"436579acebca75ccb9be17c962528d5ced918c63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/436579acebca75ccb9be17c962528d5ced918c63"}],"sha":"ee55a7f19f0573b95792b56c8bdef70807267225","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/ee55a7f19f0573b95792b56c8bdef70807267225"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commits/436579acebca75ccb9be17c962528d5ced918c63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-27T00:21:26Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-21-229.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-27T00:21:26Z","email":"ec2-user@ip-172-31-21-229.ap-northeast-1.compute.internal","name":"EC2 Default User"},"message":"refactor: Restructure directory organization following best practices\n\n## Major Changes\n\n### 📁 Documentation Consolidation\n- Organized all docs into structured categories: `architecture/`, `api/`, `deployment/`, `development/`\n- Moved legacy reports to `docs/legacy/` with proper categorization\n- Created comprehensive README files for each category\n- Updated CLAUDE.md with new file paths\n\n### 🛠️ Configuration Organization\n- Moved Docker files to `tools/docker/`\n- Moved config files to `tools/configs/` (lighthouse, playwright, next production config)\n- Updated package.json scripts to reference new paths\n\n### 🧹 File Cleanup\n- Removed obsolete backup files (.backup, .old, .new)\n- Removed temporary files (index.html, e2e-simple.spec.ts, .log files)\n- Cleaned up build artifacts (.next/trace, .tsbuildinfo)\n\n### 📊 Results\n- **Removed**: 60+ obsolete/duplicate files\n- **Reorganized**: 50+ documentation files into logical structure\n- **Maintained**: All production code and critical configs\n- **Validated**: Build, lint, and type-check all pass\n\nThis restructure follows Next.js and monorepo best practices, making the codebase more maintainable and developer-friendly.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60701138b2ec1bd46c7f80068f03f92b2cc93c86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/trees/60701138b2ec1bd46c7f80068f03f92b2cc93c86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/git/commits/436579acebca75ccb9be17c962528d5ced918c63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/436579acebca75ccb9be17c962528d5ced918c63","node_id":"C_kwDOOM6kQ9oAKDQzNjU3OWFjZWJjYTc1Y2NiOWJlMTdjOTYyNTI4ZDVjZWQ5MThjNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/20m61/v1z3r/commit/9fd161c71578b5cfc234799d74dc8d6e172d6933","sha":"9fd161c71578b5cfc234799d74dc8d6e172d6933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/20m61/v1z3r/commit